      "releaseNotes": "Lumy is ready for OS 27.\n\nAsk Lumy\n- Ask about the sun, moon, golden hour, daylight and more in natural language. Questions are understood on device, while Lumy’s own solar engine calculates the answer.\n\nOn-screen awareness\n- Looking at a place in Maps? Ask Siri to “Open this in Lumy” and the place you’re viewing comes straight into Lumy.\n\nSiri shortcuts\n- Ask for the next blue hour, get notified about sunset, or start a sun timer that can continue on your Lock Screen as a Live Activity.\n\nWeather insights\n- See what the forecast could mean for golden hour, photography and the light outside.\n\nSpotlight\n- Find upcoming sun and moon events and jump straight to the one you want.\n\nExtra Large Portrait widgets\n- See more of the sun, moon and daylight at a glance on your Home Screen.\n\nResizable windows\n- Lumy now adapts as you resize its window.\n\nWidgets and Apple Watch complications\n- Rebuilt to be more reliable, stay fresher, render faster and use less battery.\n\nThanks for continuing to use Lumy. I hope the iOS 27 update makes it feel even more useful in your day.",
