      "description": "Lumy is a modern sun tracker + outdoor activity planner.\n\n- Perfect lighting for photos or videos? Done.\n- Sunrise hike or sunset walk? Easy.\n- Outdoor yoga or sunlight breaks? Covered.\n\nWhether you’re chasing golden hour* or keeping an eye on moon phases for a night under the stars, Lumy helps you make the most of natural light.\n\nNow redesigned from the ground up - Lumy feels more personal, purposeful, and in sync with how we live. \n\nIntroducing Modes: Switch between profiles like Daily, Photography, or Meditation to shape Lumy around your routine. See only what matters to you.\n\nLumy also supports iOS’s State of Mind feature, offering sunlight suggestions based on your mood entries in the Health app - a gentle nudge to step out and connect with nature.\n\nAnd with weather forecasts for the next seven days, you can plan with confidence. Lumy calculates all sun and moon data entirely on-device. No tracking. No server calls. Only the weather needs internet.\n\nLumy works seamlessly across iPhone, iPad, Apple Watch, Apple TV, and HomePod. One purchase, full family access.\n\nFeatures\n- Modes: Switch profiles based on your needs... from weekday planning to weekend golden hour.\n- Sun + Moon Tracking: Accurate data, solar compass, and future predictions.\n- Season Info: Both astronomical and meteorological seasons.\n- Remainders: Custom repeatable notifications.\n- Apple Watch: Complications, Double-tap, and Live Activities.\n- Widgets + Control Center: Quick access via Smart Stack and more.\n- Interaction Upgrades: Time travel slider, Quick Access Button, fluid animations.\n- Visual Feel: Simulated light, shimmering glows, and enhanced Classic visuals.\n- Accessibility: VoiceOver, Dynamic Type, Reduce Motion, and more.\n- Privacy First: Fully offline (except weather). Your data stays with you.\n- Localization: Available in Japanese, Chinese, French, and German.\n\nLumy helps photographers, outdoor lovers, and wellness seekers stay in sync with the sun and moon.\n\n*What's Golden Hour?\nGolden Hour (or Magic Hour) is the short time after sunrise or before sunset when the light is soft, warm, and perfect for capturing stunning photos or videos.\n\nSun Information Available:\nSunrise, Sunset, First Light, Last Light, Golden Hour, Blue Hour, Astronomical Twilight, Nautical Twilight, Civil Twilight, Solar Noon, Solar Midnight.\n\nMoon Information Available:\nMoonrise, Moonset, Altitude, Azimuth, Transit, Transit Elevation, Weekly Moon Phase, Next Full Moon, New Moon, First Quarter, Last Quarter.\n\nGot feedback or suggestions? We’d love to hear from you! Reach out at hello@waplestuff.com.",
